{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55246","headline":"郢州白雪楼（题拟） · 张休","name":"郢州白雪楼（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人莫唱《阳春曲》，白尽湖南太守头。\n（宋王之望《汉滨集》卷二《郢守乔民瞻寄襄阳雪中三绝因追述前过石城杯酒登临之胜爲和》其三自注引。\n）（王之望诗注云：「仆旧游白雪楼，见张休诗石刻，尾章云〖诗略〗。\n今石已亡，民瞻询於老吏，遂得其全篇，云将复刻）（诸石。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}